{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2023-06-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'CHEMOURS, DUPONT, AND CORTEVA REACH COMPREHENSIVE PFAS SETTLEMENT WITH U.S. WATER SYSTEMS', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE CHEMOURS COMPANY (NYSE: CC), DUPONT DE NEMOURS, INC. (NYSE: DD) AND CORTEVA, INC. (NYSE: CTVA) (THE “COMPANIES”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE REACHED AN AGREEMENT IN PRINCIPLE TO COMPREHENSIVELY RESOLVE ALL PFAS-RELATED DRINKING WATER CLAIMS OF A DEFINED CLASS OF PUBLIC WATER SYSTEMS THAT SERVE THE VAST MAJORITY OF THE UNITED STATES POPULATION. THE CLASS INCLUDES WATER SYSTEMS WITH A CURRENT DETECTION OF PFAS1 AT ANY LEVEL AND THOSE THAT ARE CURRENTLY REQUIRE.'}